# The upstream maintainer's official patches for readline 8.2, applied in
# order, as "number:sha256". 001 fixes a crash on the first call to readline
# when LC_ALL, LC_CTYPE or LANG names a locale the host does not have
# installed -- a macOS ssh session's LC_CTYPE=UTF-8, for one.
